<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Đề thi trắc nghiệm Ma trận - Tương tác</title>
  <script>
    window.MathJax = {
      tex: { inlineMath: [['\\(', '\\)'], ['$', '$']], displayMath: [['\\[', '\\]']] },
      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }
    };
  </script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js" async></script>
  <style>
    :root{
      --blue:#0f4aa8;
      --blue2:#123b8f;
      --light:#f5f8ff;
      --line:#d8e3ff;
      --green:#10a64a;
      --red:#d93025;
      --orange:#f59e0b;
      --purple:#7c3aed;
      --text:#132033;
      --muted:#5e6b82;
      --card:#ffffff;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color:var(--text);
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef5ff,#fff7ed 55%,#f0fdf4);
      line-height:1.55;
    }
    header{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:10;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(15,74,168,.08);
    }
    .topbar{
      max-width:1180px;
      margin:auto;
      padding:16px 20px;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
      gap:16px;
      align-items:center;
    }
    .brand h1{margin:0;color:var(--blue2);font-size:28px;letter-spacing:.2px}
    .brand p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .badge{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      padding:10px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:#fff3df;
      color:#9a4f00;
      font-weight:700;
      border:1px solid #ffd59a;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }
    main{max-width:1180px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 20px 40px}
    .panel{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      gap:14px;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }
    .stat{
      background:var(--card);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:16px;
      box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(19,32,51,.06);
    }
    .stat span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .stat strong{font-size:24px;color:var(--blue2)}
    .controls{
      background:var(--card);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:16px;
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:10px;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(19,32,51,.06);
    }
    .filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    button{
      border:none;
      cursor:pointer;
      border-radius:12px;
      padding:10px 13px;
      font-weight:700;
      transition:.18s ease;
      font-size:14px;
    }
    .filter-btn{background:#eef4ff;color:var(--blue2);border:1px solid #cfe0ff}
    .filter-btn.active,.filter-btn:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}
    .reset{background:#fff0f0;color:#b42318;border:1px solid #ffd1d1}
    .reset:hover{background:#d93025;color:white}
    .question{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-left:7px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius:20px;
      margin:16px 0;
      padding:18px;
      box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(19,32,51,.07);
    }
    .question.easy{border-left-color:var(--green)}
    .question.medium{border-left-color:var(--orange)}
    .question.hard{border-left-color:var(--red)}
    .question.theory{border-left-color:var(--purple)}
    .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:center}
    .tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef4ff;color:var(--blue2)}
    .tag.easy{background:#e9f9ef;color:#087836}
    .tag.medium{background:#fff5df;color:#a15a00}
    .tag.hard{background:#ffecec;color:#b42318}
    .tag.theory{background:#f2eaff;color:#5b21b6}
    .q-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 14px;color:#0d2450}
    .options{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:10px}
    .option{
      width:100%;
      text-align:left;
      background:#f8fbff;
      color:#17223a;
      border:1px solid #dce7ff;
      border-radius:14px;
      padding:12px 14px;
      font-weight:600;
    }
    .option:hover:not(:disabled){background:#edf5ff;transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .option.correct{background:#dff7e8;border-color:#47c879;color:#075e2b}
    .option.wrong{background:#ffe3e3;border-color:#f06a63;color:#9b1c13}
    .option:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.95}
    .feedback{
      display:none;
      margin-top:14px;
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#f7fbff;
      border:1px dashed #bad0ff;
    }
    .feedback.show{display:block}
    .feedback h4{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--blue2)}
    .explain{margin:6px 0}
    .tip{
      margin-top:10px;
      padding:10px 12px;
      border-radius:12px;
      background:#fff7e6;
      border:1px solid #ffd89c;
      color:#7a4300;
    }
    .footer-note{
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-top:26px;
      font-size:13px;
    }
    .hidden{display:none}
    @media(max-width:850px){.panel{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.topbar{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brand h1{font-size:23px}.badge{width:max-content}}
    @media(max-width:520px){.panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}.controls{align-items:stretch}.filters,.reset{width:100%}.filter-btn{flex:1}.q-title{font-size:16px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>ĐỀ THI TRẮC NGHIỆM MA TRẬN</h1>
      <p>20 câu tương tác: 5 lý thuyết + 15 bài tập theo mức độ dễ, trung bình, khó</p>
    </div>
    <div class="badge">drDuyMT style · Hiểu bản chất rồi làm nhanh</div>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
  <section class="panel">
    <div class="stat"><span>Tổng số câu</span><strong id="totalQ">20</strong></div>
    <div class="stat"><span>Đã làm</span><strong id="doneQ">0</strong></div>
    <div class="stat"><span>Số câu đúng</span><strong id="correctQ">0</strong></div>
    <div class="stat"><span>Điểm tạm tính</span><strong id="scoreQ">0.0</strong></div>
  </section>

  <section class="controls">
    <div class="filters">
      <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">Tất cả</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="theory">Lý thuyết</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="easy">Dễ</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="medium">Trung bình</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="hard">Khó</button>
    </div>
    <button class="reset" onclick="resetQuiz()">Làm lại đề</button>
  </section>

  <section id="quiz"></section>
  <p class="footer-note">Gợi ý: hãy làm theo cấu trúc “kích thước → điều kiện → công thức → tính toán”, không học ma trận như một đống công thức rời rạc.</p>
</main>

